  <bioghist id="55127d56ccd34608c836e36a350d637f">
    <head>Biographical / Historical</head>
<p>Reed Hertford (1938-2012) was a specialist in agricultural development who worked for several years at the Ford Foundation. Hertford's positions at the Ford Foundation included Program Advisor in the Latin America and Caribbean, Columbia and Venezuela Program, Program Officer in the larger Latin America and Caribbean Program, and Program Advisor in the Asia and Pacific Program. He earned a Ph.D. in economics from the University of Chicago and worked at Rutgers University after leaving the Ford Foundation.</p>  </bioghist>
